        "description": "<p>A lightweight WordPress plugin that adds word-switching functionality to Gutenberg editor&#8217;s<br />\nParagraph and Heading blocks, allowing users to dynamically replace or rotate<br />\nselected words for more engaging and flexible content presentation.</p>\n<p>With this plugin, WordPress gutenberg editor’s paragraph and heading block get an extra format named ‘word switch’.</p>\n<h3>Let&#8217;s see how it works</h3>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a-s5YnXF1QM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h3>1.1.1</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Video instruction added</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>1.1.0</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple seperate word switching feature</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>1.0.2</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Change prefix WS to WORD_SWITCH</li>\n<li>Made zip for wordpress.org</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>1.0.1</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Change prefix WS to WORD_SWITCH</li>\n<li>Made zip for wordpress.org</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>1.0.0</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add word switching functionality in Gutenberg</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
